{"id": 27940, "field": "description", "ja": "魂をこの世に繋ぎ止め、死亡した\n場所へ魂が戻れば如何なる悲惨な\n死からも蘇ることができるように\nする!", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#3205"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 27941, "field": "description", "ja": "危険な小動物を食い止める。ただし、\n小動物を傷つけた場合、護符の強力な\n防御魔法は一時的に消滅する。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#3206"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 27944, "field": "description", "ja": "身に着けると、何の変哲もない場所で\n貴重な品物が見つかるかもしれない!", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#3207"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 27945, "field": "description", "ja": "楽々と海を泳げるようにする。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#3208"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
